{"unit_id":"tdf1995__dsh-plugin-vision#card-zh","repo":"tdf1995/dsh-plugin-vision","commit":"6b814157e82af5e8c8c68dec54901ad694d02ee8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-vision 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 与会话工具的视觉插件：它注册 see_image、vision_set_key 和 vision_status，并在 Web 输入区提供粘贴、拖放及选择图片的附件界面。用户可用 Gemini 或 GLM 对本地图片进行描述、OCR 和视觉问答；自动模式根据可用凭据选择服务，并在符合条件的失败后重试或切换。图片经 DSH 工具读取并发送给所选视觉 API，浏览器添加的图片会先保存到工作区。适合需要让文本模型理解截图、文档和图表的 DSH 用户。需要配置 Gemini 或 GLM 的 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:552-663","lib/index.js:401-549","lib/client.js:107-145"]}
{"unit_id":"tdf1995__dsh-plugin-vision#card-en","repo":"tdf1995/dsh-plugin-vision","commit":"6b814157e82af5e8c8c68dec54901ad694d02ee8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-vision lets text-only DSH models analyze local images with Gemini or GLM. Its tool supports description, OCR, and visual questions with automatic provider selection and retry. A Web composer also accepts pasted, dropped, or attached images. A Gemini or GLM API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:552-663","lib/index.js:401-549","lib/client.js:107-145"]}
