{"unit_id":"tdf1995__dsh-plugin-vision#feature-1","repo":"tdf1995/dsh-plugin-vision","commit":"6b814157e82af5e8c8c68dec54901ad694d02ee8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-vision 的功能「图像分析与问答」：通过 see_image 读取 PNG、JPEG、WebP 或 GIF 本地图片，并把问题与图像交给 Gemini 或 GLM，返回模型文本结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:401-431","lib/index.js:552-585"]}
{"unit_id":"tdf1995__dsh-plugin-vision#feature-2","repo":"tdf1995/dsh-plugin-vision","commit":"6b814157e82af5e8c8c68dec54901ad694d02ee8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-vision 的功能「双视觉提供商」：可选择 Gemini 或 GLM，也可自动按可用 Key 选择；自动模式记住最近成功的提供商，并在可重试失败时切换。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:433-450","lib/index.js:496-549"]}
{"unit_id":"tdf1995__dsh-plugin-vision#feature-3","repo":"tdf1995/dsh-plugin-vision","commit":"6b814157e82af5e8c8c68dec54901ad694d02ee8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-vision 的功能「凭据管理」：vision_set_key 将 Gemini 或 GLM Key 写入 DSH credentials 服务；vision_status 查看配置来源与状态，不回显 Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:588-658"]}
{"unit_id":"tdf1995__dsh-plugin-vision#feature-4","repo":"tdf1995/dsh-plugin-vision","commit":"6b814157e82af5e8c8c68dec54901ad694d02ee8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-vision 的功能「Web 图片附件」：在 Web 输入框粘贴、拖入或选择图片，显示可移除的附件卡片，并把图片路径追加到草稿供后续提问。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:107-145","lib/client.js:160-179","lib/client.js:279-290"]}
{"unit_id":"tdf1995__dsh-plugin-vision#feature-5","repo":"tdf1995/dsh-plugin-vision","commit":"6b814157e82af5e8c8c68dec54901ad694d02ee8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-vision 的功能「大图处理」：当图片超过配置阈值时，尝试用 Windows pwsh/System.Drawing 缩小图片；不满足条件或处理失败时继续使用原图。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:305-355","lib/index.js:422-431"]}
